StarFighter AMD / F2-A bring-up notes
=====================================

Base
----
- Structural base: `src/mainboard/google/myst`
- SoC family: `soc/amd/phoenix`
- Local board policy reference: `src/mainboard/starlabs/cezanne`

AMI source
----------
- `/home/sean/Documents/arn39/ARN39EP023`
- Project token: `OemProjectPkg/ARN39EP/ARN39EP.sdl`
- Public product naming should follow StarFighter, not the factory ARN39 ref.
- Board is wired as Phoenix FP7 / Mayan-class in the AMI tree.

Artifacts to mine next
----------------------
- Final BIOS:
  - `Build/Phoenix/RELEASE_VS2015/FV/AMIROM.fd`
  - signed output `ARN39EP.rom`
- EC blob:
  - `OemProjectPkg/ARN39EP/OemEcMirror/OemEcMirror.sdl`
- PD blobs:
